  "raw_label": "-1",
  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Kalim Rahim Shah vs The State Of Maharashtra on 1 August, 2025 -1- In The High Court Of Judicature At Bombay Bench At Aurangabad 910 Anticipatory Bail Application No. 1262 Of 2025 Kalim Rahim Shah Versus The State Of Maharashtra Mr.J.I.Shaikh, Advocate for the Applicant. Mr.S.B.Narwade, App for the Respondent/State. ( Coram : Advait M. Sethna, J. ) Date : 01 August 2025 P. C. : 1. 3. The Applicant has approached this Court u/s 482 of the Bharatiya Nagarik Suraksha Sanhita, 2023 (\"Bnss\") as he apprehends arrest. 3. The proceedings relate to Crime No.0059/2025.",
    "facts": "3. The Applicant has approached this Court u/s 482 of the Bharatiya Nagarik Suraksha Sanhita, 2023 (\"Bnss\") as he apprehends arrest. 3. The proceedings relate to Crime No.0059/2025. The FIR is lodged on 10 February 2025 at 17.00 Hours with the Rahata Police Station, Dist.Ahilyanagar. The offences are registered u/s 26(2), 26(2) khs/Aug.2025/1262 -2- (a), 27(3)(d), 27(3)(e) of the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006 and under Sections 123, 223, 274 and 275 of the Bharatiya Nyaya Sanhita, Kalim Rahim Shah vs The State Of Maharashtra on 1 August, 2025 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/182944810/ 1 2023. The occurrence of the offence is shown on 10 February 2025. There are three different crimes are registered against the accused person, who is the Applicant before the Court. In this crime, Informant is one Balasaheb Ashok Gunjal, Police Constable B.No.176. 4. From a perusal of the FIR, it appears that the issue here is regarding supplier of the contraband (gutka). The parties would submit that the issue with regard to such contraband ( gutka) is a subject matter of pending proceedings in ABA No.857/2025 alongwith other connected applications.",
